{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45632","headline":"冬末病中作二首 二 · 贯休","name":"冬末病中作二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胸中有一物，旅拒复攻击。\n向下还上来，唯疑是肺石。\n山童顽且小，用之复何益。\n教洗煮茶铛，雪团打邻壁。\n宛转无好姿，裴回更何适。\n庭前早梅树，坐见花尽碧。\n屋老多鼠窠，窗卑露山脊。\n近来胸中物，已似输药力。\n微吟复微今，依稀似庄舃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}